        {
          "id": "eb357f45-27db-4ad0-8775-fdee81b6bf2a",
          "name": "Add overtime",
          "request": {
            "name": "Add overtime",
            "description": {
              "content": "Prefer to use the **Payment Data Sync** endpoint\n\nAllows to indicate the number of overtime hours that a Colaborador worked during a given month. This method **replaces** the amount of overtime, it does not add to existing overtime.\n\n\nAn object of type Overtime must be sent as JSON in the body of the request, composed of:\n- day: Day to determine to which period the overtime belongs (optional)\n- month: The month corresponding to overtime\n- year: The year the overtime corresponds to\n- hours: Number of overtime hours to add\n- employee_id: ID of the Colaborador to whom to associate overtime.\n- type_id: ID of the type of overtime to add\n- centro_costo: Cost center code to which the overtime will be charged}\n\n**Permisos requeridos para utilizar este endpoint:** \n* Attendance permissions en: 'Lectura y Modificación'.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "attendances",
                "overtime"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "method": "PUT",
            "auth": null
          },
          "response": [
